    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "1EEACFED15ABF95A",
      "text": "Bienvenue à l’Arène de Sevaro ! Souhaitez-vous\\nécouter à nouveau les modalités de l’examen ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "1EEACEED15ABF7A7",
      "text": "Afin de passer l’examen, vous devrez réussir\\nl’épreuve du [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Roule-Olive[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "1EEACDED15ABF5F4",
      "text": "Vous devrez pousser un ballon en forme\\nd’olive jusqu’à la ligne d’arrivée.\\c\\nSi vous y parvenez, cela sera de bon augure pour\\nles récoltes de l’année prochaine !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "1EEACCED15ABF441",
      "text": "La Place Roule-Olive se trouve [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]au nord[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]de la ville[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] !\\c\\nLe personnel sur place se fera un plaisir\\nde vous fournir des explications plus détaillées.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "5BE83F2D0544DB8E",
      "text": "Si vous souhaitez participer au Roule-Olive,\\nc’est ici que ça se passe !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "5BE83E2D0544D9DB",
      "text": "C’est une épreuve physique où il faut pousser\\nun ballon géant ressemblant à une olive.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "5BE83D2D0544D828",
      "text": "Si vous arrivez à guider le ballon jusqu’au panier\\nà l’arrivée, tout en franchissant les obstacles\\r\\nsur votre route, vous réussirez l’examen !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "5BE8442D0544E40D",
      "text": "Voilà, vous savez tout. Alors, êtes-vous prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e\\nà passer votre examen d’Arène ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "5BE8432D0544E25A",
      "text": "Parfait ! Et pendant que vous poussez le ballon,\\npensez à nous souhaiter une bonne récolte !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "5BE8422D0544E0A7",
      "text": "D’accord. Revenez me voir lorsque\\nvous serez prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "5BE8412D0544DEF4",
      "text": "Vous revoilà ! Vous sentez-vous prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à relever\\nle défi du Roule-Olive ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "5BE8382D0544CFA9",
      "text": "Si t’arrives à me vaincre, je te laisserai prendre\\nun raccourci !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "5BE8372D0544CDF6",
      "text": "Voyons un peu si tu arrives à passer mon mur\\nd’Olivini pour rattraper le temps perdu !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "5BE4BA2D0541C3B8",
      "text": "Allez, les Olivini, vous pouvez dégager\\nle passage, maintenant !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_11",
      "hash64": "5BE4BB2D0541C56B",
      "text": "Tu peux essayer de pousser ton olive avec\\nune monture, ça devrait t’aider à la faire rouler !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_12",
      "hash64": "5BE4BC2D0541C71E",
      "text": "Grâce à vous, nous aurons d’excellentes récoltes\\nl’année prochaine, c’est certain !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_13",
      "hash64": "5BE4BD2D0541C8D1",
      "text": "Considérez votre examen d’Arène comme réussi !\\nToutes mes félicitations !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_14",
      "hash64": "5BE4BE2D0541CA84",
      "text": "Vous pouvez retourner à la réception de l’Arène\\npour les informer de votre réussite !\\c\\nEt surtout, bon courage pour votre combat face\\nà la Championne !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_15",
      "hash64": "5BE4BF2D0541CC37",
      "text": "Souhaitez-vous interrompre le Roule-Olive ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_16",
      "hash64": "5BE4C02D0541CDEA",
      "text": "Êtes-vous sûr[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
