    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "8B7B0826C1D6E9A3",
      "text": "Non, je veux continuer.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "8B7B0926C1D6EB56",
      "text": "Oui, je veux arrêter.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_19",
      "hash64": "5BE4B32D0541B7D3",
      "text": "Tu croyais pouvoir éviter les difficultés en prenant\\nun raccourci ? Eh ben, c’est raté !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_21",
      "hash64": "5BEEAB2D0549FEC0",
      "text": "Les Olivini ont reconnu ta valeur et vont te céder\\nle passage !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_20",
      "hash64": "5BEEAC2D054A0073",
      "text": "Si je t’ai empêché[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e de faire rouler ton ballon\\navec un combat, c’est pour te montrer à quel\\r\\npoint c’est difficile de cultiver des olives !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
